  "notes": "{混|ま}じる is an intransitive verb meaning to be mixed in or present among other things.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{混|ま}ぜる→混ぜる：02423_mazeru⟧ (transitive, to mix)\n\nCONTRAST WITH ⟦{混|ま}ざる→混ざる：02420_mazaru⟧:\n- {混|ま}じる: emphasizes presence/inclusion (something is among)\n- ⟦{混|ま}ざる→混ざる：02420_mazaru⟧: emphasizes blending/combining\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{白髪|しらが}→白髪：00369_shiraga⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{混|ま}じって⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧: there are gray hairs mixed in\n- ⟦{外国人|がいこくじん}→外国人：02869_gaikokujin⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{混|ま}じって⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧: there are foreigners among them\n- ⟦{赤|あか}→赤：02842_aka⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{混|ま}じって⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧: there's some red mixed in\n- ⟦{嘘|うそ}→嘘：01796_uso⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{混|ま}じって⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧: there are lies mixed in\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{交|まじ}わる→交わる：18379_majiwaru⟧: to intersect, associate with others\n- ⟦{混|ま}ざる→混ざる：02420_mazaru⟧: to be blended together",
